Package: tando
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: bash, openssh-client, rsync
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/@REPO@
Description: deploy apps from your laptop to your own Linux server over ssh
 tando builds on the laptop, uploads by rsync and runs each app under systemd behind Caddy.
 The Linux server programs (amd64 and arm64) travel inside this package and are installed on
 a server over ssh by `tando host setup`; this package runs nothing on its own.
